** <code>USARTC0_RXC</code>: USART 0 on port C transmit complete
** <code>NVM_EE</code>: Non-Volatile Memory EEPROM
** <code>NVM_SPM</code>: Non-Volatile Memory SPM
** <code>PORTB_INT0</code>: Port B Interrupt0
** <code>PORTB_INT1</code>: Port B Interrupt1
** <code>PORTE_INT0</code>: Port E Interrupt0
** <code>PORTE_INT1</code>: Port E Interrupt1
